---
import Layout from "../layouts/default.astro";
export const title = "Terms of Service";
---

<Layout title={title} desc="sirkorgo.com Terms of Service">
  <div class="content">
    <h1>Terms of Service & Privacy Statement</h1>
    <p>Last Updated: February 23, 2026</p>
    <p>
      By using this website, you agree to these terms for korgoserver applications, specifically
      Nextcloud and Immich.
    </p>

    <ol>
      <li>
        <b>No Data Collection or Storage</b><br />
        I do not collect, store, or log any personal data, user profiles, uploaded files, or metadata.<br
        />
        Authentication Only: The site facilitates authentication tokens (e.g., OIDC, JWT) to log in to
        your self-hosted Nextcloud or Immich instances.<br />
        No Tracking: I do not use tracking cookies, analytics, or third-party services that profile user
        behavior.
      </li>
      <br />
      <li>
        <b>Third-Party App Responsibility</b><br />
        This site acts only as a bridge. Once authenticated, your data resides entirely within your own
        Nextcloud or Immich environment. I have no access to your files. You are responsible for the security,
        backup, and management of your data within those applications.
      </li>
      <br />
      <li>
        <b>Limitation of Liability</b><br />
        I provide this service "as is." I am not responsible for any downtime, technical failures, or
        data loss that may occur within your self-hosted apps.
      </li>
      <br />
      <li>
        <b>Changes to Terms</b><br />
        I may update this statement at any time. Your continued use of the site constitutes acceptance
        of any changes.
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</Layout>
